{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bad1dce1acf70c0a653c05081396bc3b61fd08215c3fb952bb35b6e8e1e74b74", "ja": "あれっ？　貴音。\n今日って何か予定あったっけ？　レッスンとか。", "zh": "咦？贵音。\n今天是不是有什么安排来着？比如练习之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "6ecc6cd9b5889579ff3955562445ef0c268a1972ef824c3de76d16d1dcc8a52c", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\n今日は特にありません。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n今天没有特别的安排。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6346ec4ee65d0c6bc027fe600e9060f7f6b792b6453533cd2a5be7f975ab2983", "ja": "そうか。じゃあ適当に帰ること。\nしっかり休むのも、仕事のうちだからな。", "zh": "这样啊。那你就先回去吧。\n好好休息也是工作的一部分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "d40022cc789c78e86c835f0d2f8cc4076df64f4dddd8f2ef77c3be9f62a61c35", "ja": "はい、ですが、もう少しだけこちらに……。\n{$P$}は、まだお仕事ですか？", "zh": "是的，不过请再在这里待一会儿……  \n{$P$}还在工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4f64e92e00f0a3b1db3c6a34ff897852fd2e93e3cfba75aa042b35c2518b990b", "ja": "そうだな、まだ忙しくて……。\n嬉しい悲鳴ってヤツだな。それじゃ、お疲れさま！", "zh": "是啊，还忙着呢……\n这就叫痛并快乐着吧。那么，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1006_p", "source_sha256": "29df2eeb18373981f0900609b85eeceb1861ca34c2576d6e5a36de4d42614389", "ja": "あれっ？　貴音、まだ残ってたのか。\n早く帰った方がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "哎？贵音，你还没走吗。\n是不是早点回去比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "029e11b89521f3e23f216a90241bdb96147d9d1b3f1e5c7e1e1804f74f31d319", "ja": "お疲れさまです。ええと……。\n{$P$}は、まだお仕事ですか？", "zh": "辛苦了。那个……\n{$P$}还在工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1008_p", "source_sha256": "004063706ab2d1ea01dec964a2b8872746139d878cce5f341e843f057c1271f9", "ja": "うん？　そうだな、もう少しだとは思うけど……。\nじゃあ、お疲れさま。早く帰るんだぞ！", "zh": "嗯？这个嘛，我觉得还差一点就结束了……\n那就辛苦了。早点回去啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8b9e8c65a32a199ac3f2ad25a794ec7574446443fbc86d29ebecea8645aa75ab", "ja": "あれっ！？　貴音、まだいたのか！？", "zh": "咦！？贵音，你还没走吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "db1f9afc4c917daf58e3fa8ac7a9ebab9104b53ae2eb6a3bd06c95bcc140a802", "ja": "…………。\nお仕事は、どうされましたか？", "zh": "…………。\n工作处理得怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d297e846d81a751c7e728f363fca359235538eecd271356bc1f98165611aef28", "ja": "え？　ああ、今終わったところだけど……。", "zh": "咦？啊，刚刚才结束……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "5996ff7ce4f2a2806f853b299501ad11bc4a9ba9a5623312d01bc9478ce51004", "ja": "ふぅ……私は、あなた様をお待ちしていたのです。\n何か美味しいものを、共に食べに行きたいと。", "zh": "呼……我一直在等您。\n想和您一起去吃点美味的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7652cac8bc8c8a6662907a086ec9d728cca6a7ad22f6d61da472da0696967133", "ja": "えっ！？　ずっと！？", "zh": "咦！？一直在等吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "fc4c56bb5aa1238e442903fff60effad88716dab9f24dce158c08c6a56df811a", "ja": "ええ。みゅーじっくふぇすや、センター公演の\nご褒美を、まだいただいておりませんでしたので。", "zh": "是的。因为音乐节和中心公演的\n奖励，我还没有领取。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "f53f7c6230305c1f0ed9f04896c0ccf562f0c43fe7eba2922ba453aaff838739", "ja": "少し、わがままを言わせていただこうと思ったの\nですが。真、あなた様はいけずな方ですね……。", "zh": "我本想着稍微任性一回的。\n真，您可真是个坏心眼的人呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6c76cc981343a60f583deee1638a2f1aa1f5db219f938f519d48c93279ef717f", "ja": "そ、それは……本当にゴメン！　気づけなくて。", "zh": "那、那个……真的很对不起！我没能察觉到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1018_p", "source_sha256": "19bc5191511f0ea700ae95092f28daa182d52786cb06d43155f2eba64528e6a5", "ja": "それで、ええと……今からでよければ、\n一緒に行こうか？　何か食べに。", "zh": "那么，呃……现在出发的话，可以一起去吗？去吃点什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1019_008tak", "source_sha256": "1bc92d151d0d547e76d0465d93d9682769a76e2b93a907f6f0d9dcfe1573c7f6", "ja": "……。ふふっ、その言葉を待っておりました。\nお供いたします……あなた様♪", "zh": "……呵呵，我一直在等您这句话。\n我陪您一起去……亲爱的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_117_1020_p", "source_sha256": "85271b9f04dff31721c7c701dbc2e79fe0c97e1a89df4b47d9e6f0e60683d2b4", "ja": "（子どもっぽい拗ねた表情は、一瞬で大人びた\n表情に変わった……どちらも貴音の魅力なのだろう）", "zh": "（孩子气的闹别扭表情，一瞬间就变成了成熟的表情……这两种模样大概都是贵音的魅力吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
